# Applies only to Dockerfile (BuildKit's <name>.dockerignore convention). The
# build context is the parent directory so the sibling extension repos can be
# COPY'd in (see docker-build.sh); keep local build output out of it so the
# extensions always compile from source inside the image instead of reusing a
# stale prebuilt labextension (hatch skips the build if one is present) or
# shipping a developer's node_modules.
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.yarn
**/lib
**/labextension
**/_version.py
**/.DS_Store
